## Then image transformation

For ICPay Cloud, I'd make this very simple:

```text
getImageUrl(fileId, {
    width,
    height,
    quality,
    format,
    fit
})
```

Example:

```text
getImageUrl("abc123", {
    width: 800,
    format: "webp",
    quality: 80
})
```

Result:

```text
https://6vbhm-nqaaa-aaaan-q6muq-cai.raw.icp0.io/bucket/file.webp?w=800&q=80
```

This is where ICPay can start behaving like a lightweight **Cloudinary alternative**, rather than just being an on-chain Dropbox.

